TITLE Mix 50 mmol/kg DIC with 50 mmol/kg Ca (1:1), heat 20 to 200C, equilibrium with calcite
SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.tsv
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step temp_C Ca_species_count
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, TC, TOT("Ca")
END
PRINT
    -species true
    -equilibrium_phases true
